DOES ONE OBJECTIVE EVEN GIVE ONE ANSWER ACROSS THE SWEEP?

  pure-time objective, distinct winning arms across the six record counts: 4  ['d16', 'd16-control', 'd32', 'd64']
  pure-space objective, distinct winning arms across the six record counts: 1  ['packed-simd']
  -> a single objective's mechanism answer is not a constant either.
     It is a function of the workload, which is 25 section 4.4's claim
     that a strategy assigns functions rather than values, holding on
     an axis 25 did not measure.

