ARE THE INTERIOR WEIGHTINGS REDUNDANT?

  A compromise objective is worth naming only if it selects something
  no pure objective selects. The two pure objectives are the two ends
  of the weighting range, so an arm in the hull set that is neither
  end is an arm reachable only from the interior.

     records  count  arms only an interior weighting selects 
       16384      2  d16, d32                                
      131072      1  d16-control                             
     1048576      1  d16                                     
     2097152      0  (none)                                  
     4194304      0  (none)                                  
     8388608      0  (none)                                  

